"S1\",\"actor\":\"Resident\",\"goal\":\"Receive an applicable, authoritative weather warning in time to take protective action.\",\"trigger\":\"The regional weather authority issues or changes a warning affecting the resident's area.\",\"preconditions\":\"An authoritative warning source, affected-area mapping, resident reachability, and delivery channel exist.\",\"main_path\":\"The service obtains the authoritative warning, determines the affected recipients, delivers it through the selected channel, and clearly identifies the warning and issuing authority.\",\"alternatives\":[\"The authority updates or cancels a warning.\",\"A resident needs an accessible or translated presentation.\"],\"failures\":[\"The authoritative source is unavailable or stale.\",\"Delivery is delayed, duplicated, or fails.\",\"Location or recipient targeting is incorrect.\"],\"postconditions\":\"The resident can distinguish the current authoritative warning and its status; delivery outcome is operationally visible.\",\"rules\":[\"R1: Residents receive applicable warnings (E1).\",\"R2: Warning meaning and classification come from the regional weather authority (E1).\"],\"status\":\"proposed\",\"sources\":[\"E1\"]}]}\n```\n\n## Scope & Exclusions\n\nداخل النطاق: تحديد الأطراف، رحلة التحذير، مصادر السلطة، وقرارات/أدلة البحث المطلوبة.\n\nخارج النطاق حاليًا: اختيار التقنية، تصميم التطبيق، اختيار قناة بالنيابة عن المالك، إعادة تعريف التحذيرات، أو تنفيذ الخدمة.\n\n## Constraints & Dependencies\n\n- قناة التوصيل تؤثر على الوصول، الموافقات، التكلفة، الاعتمادية وإتاحة الرسائل.\n- الخدمة تعتمد على مصدر رسمي قابل للاستهلاك وتعريف واضح للنطاق الجغرافي ودورة تحديث/إلغاء التحذير.\n- لا يجوز اعتبار أي تعريف مقترح بديلًا لتعريفات الهيئة.\n- تعذر البحث الخارجي حاليًا يعني إن حقائق المصدر الرسمي والتكامل ما زالت غير متحققة.\n\n## Decisions & Assumptions\n\n```json\n{\"decisions\":[{\"id\":\"D1\",\"statement\":\"The regional weather authority remains the decision owner for warning definitions.\",\"status\":\"accepted\",\"origin\":\"conversation:USER REQUEST\",\"authority\":\"requesting user reporting the domain ownership boundary\",\"sources\":[\"E1\"],\"consequence\":\"The service must consume and reproduce authoritative definitions rather than inventing severity or warning rules.\"},{\"id\":\"D2\",\"statement\":\"No delivery channel is selected.\",\"status\":\"provisional\",\"origin\":\"conversation:USER REQUEST\",\"authority\":\"requesting user\",\"sources\":[\"E1\"],\"consequence\":\"Channel-specific requirements and feasibility cannot yet be finalized.\"}]}\n```\n\n## Open Gaps & Owners\n\n```json\n{\"gaps\":[{\"id\":\"G1\",\"type\":\"user_decision\",\"question\":\"Which delivery channel, or channel-selection priority, should govern the first release?\",\"impact\":\"Changes reach, consent requirements, accessibility, operating cost, delivery evidence, and failure handling.\",\"blocking\":true,\"state\":\"open\",\"owner\":\"requesting user/product owner\",\"route\":\"Choose a channel or provide ranked criteria such as reach, urgency, accessibility, cost, and opt-in constraints.\",\"depends_on\":[],\"sources\":[\"E1\"]},{\"id\":\"G2\",\"type\":\"other_stakeholder\",\"question\":\"What are the authority's official warning definitions, lifecycle rules, geographic model, and attribution requirements?\",\"impact\":\"The service cannot safely interpret, target, update, or cancel warnings without authoritative rules.\",\"blocking\":true,\"state\":\"open\",\"owner\":\"regional weather authority\",\"route\":\"Obtain the authority's official policy/specification or a named authority contact; do not infer definitions.\",\"depends_on\":[],\"sources\":[\"E1\"]},{\"id\":\"G3\",\"type\":\"external_fact\",\"question\":\"What official machine-readable feed or integration interface is available, with what freshness, authentication, and usage limits?\",\"impact\":\"Determines whether timely and reliable warning acquisition is feasible.\",\"blocking\":true,\"state\":\"open\",\"owner\":\"domain researcher / regional weather authority\",\"route\":\"When external access becomes available, inspect the authority's official integration documentation or obtain it directly from the authority.\",\"depends_on\":[\"G2\"],\"sources\":[\"E1\"]},{\"id\":\"G4\",\"type\":\"user_decision\",\"question\":\"Which residents and geographic area must the initial service cover, including language and accessibility needs?\",\"impact\":\"Changes targeting, message presentation, channel suitability, and operational scope.\",\"blocking\":true,\"state\":\"open\",\"owner\":\"requesting user/product owner\",\"route\":\"Define the initial community boundary and required accessibility/language coverage.\",\"depends_on\":[],\"sources\":[\"E1\"]}]}\n```\n\n## Context Pointers\n\n- الطلب الحالي: `conversation:USER REQUEST`\n- المصدر المطلوب لاحقًا: مواصفات وتعريفات التحذير الرسمية الصادرة عن هيئة الأرصاد الإقليمية.\n- لا توجد مواصفات مشروع أو تطبيق قائم مشار إليه.\n\n## Readiness & Next Handoff\n\n```json\n{\"readiness\":{\"status\":\"needs_user_decision\",\"sufficiently_known\":\"The beneficiary, core outcome, greenfield state, authority boundary, read-only constraint, and representative warning journey are known.\",\"next_receiver\":\"product owner, followed by regional-weather domain researcher\",\"actions\":[\"Product owner selects the initial delivery channel or supplies ranked selection criteria.\",\"Product owner defines the initial population, geography, language, and accessibility boundary.\",\"Regional weather authority supplies its official warning definitions and lifecycle rules.\",\"Once external access is available, domain research verifies the authority's official feed and operational constraints.\"],\"limitations\":[\"No delivery channel has been chosen.\",\"Authoritative warning definitions and integration details have not been inspected.\",\"External research is unavailable in the current environment.\",\"This chat handoff is provisional and was not written or validated as a canonical file.\"]}}\n```\n\nأعلى سؤال لازم يتحسم: **إيه قناة التوصيل المطلوبة لأول إصدار، أو إيه ترتيب الأولويات اللي نختار على أساسه القناة؟**",
